OL,3,GNEWSADrumcree policing operation has
OL,4,Acost #3m so far, says Boutcher
OL,5,
OL,6,FChief Constable Jon Boutcher has said
OL,7,Fthe policing operation over the
OL,8,FDrumcree parading dispute has cost
OL,9,Fabout #3m so far.
OL,11,FSpeaking at a meeting of the Policing
OL,12,FBoard, he described the situation as
OL,13,F"challenging" - but said that despite
OL,14,F"very significant tensions" there had
OL,15,Fbeen no violence.
OL,17,FThe stand-off - over a proposed Orange
OL,18,FOrder parade in Portadown, opposed by
OL,19,Fnationalist residents of the Garvaghy
OL,20,FRoad - has lasted since Sunday morning.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
