OL,3,GNEWSADrumcree policing operation has
OL,4,Acost #3m so far, says Boutcher
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Police Service of Northern Ireland
OL,7,F(PSNI) has deployed a significant
OL,8,Fnumber of officers, with Boutcher
OL,9,Fsaying he had a responsibility to
OL,10,Fpreserve peace and maintain order.
